    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Hesai Group is a Shanghai-based public company that describes itself as a global leader in 3D perception and lidar solutions. According to its website, it makes lidar sensors for ADAS, autonomous vehicles, trucking, robotics, and industrial applications, and says its lidars are mass-produced and delivered to customers in over 40 countries. It describes lidar as the eyes of intelligent vehicles, enabling features such as AEB (Automated Emergency Braking) and NOA (Navigation on Autopilot), and says its sensors meet the standards for L4+ autonomous driving used by robotaxis and robobuses.\n\nThe company says it partners with automotive OEMs, autonomous vehicle companies, and robotics companies worldwide. It presents its sensors as high-performance and reliable for semi-autonomous and fully autonomous driving.\n\nHesai Group is registered with the SEC under CIK 0001861737 and trades under the ticker HSAI. No lawsuits or MCP servers are recorded for it, and no specific products are tracked in the data provided.",
